  "requirements": [
    "Actual source marker identity is a normal trait contract, never a Copy/Clone/auto-trait implementation proof.",
    "Use expressions and closure formation choose Copy, then actual Clone when UseCloned is proved, otherwise move. Generic bodies retain their original choice.",
    "Feature and actual keyword/macro authority, borrow/move/init checks, source body effects, one-time operand evaluation, exact capture paths, const-call effects and imported identity remain distinct.",
    "General role/body transport must fail explicitly until its actual checked profile exists.",
    "All required operations remain part of the compiler goal even while current source-declaration work advances original core."
  ],
  "hypothesis_history": {
